{comment: Chorus}
We’ve come to praise Him,
We’ve come to praise Him
We’ve come to praise Him and
Lift His holy name

{comment: Bridge}
Make a joyful noise unto the Lord,
Make a joyful noise unto the Lord
You ought to praise the Lord
While you have the chance
